Actually there is only one habit, PATIENCE.

Have you tried to read all the spoilers. Get them all at
http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/nethack/spoilerlist.html

If yes then try the gnomish healer as a pacifist.
Use Elbereth to avoid monsters.
Let your pet kill them. Let it grow to large variety.
Then go to mines.
Pray if you are short on food, and you get weak due to hunger.
Try to survive till you get Protection, from the minetown priest.
To do this you need enormous patience and careful playing.
Once you succeed two-three times consecutively you will know
that you have built the most important habit needed to win this game.

I would say try to play one class only during a large no. of games,
as each requires different strategy in the beginning game. So you will
learn those strategies. They will be useful in all games.

That was very useful for me. I had never ascended before I tried this.

